  "id": "one-parameter-model",
  "term": "one-parameter model",
  "definition": "In this context, a one-parameter model is a functional connectivity prediction model that uses only anatomical distance as its single input. It assumes that greater distance reduces the likelihood or strength of connectivity, but the source says this alone does not capture several important network features of normal human brain functional networks.",
